After a long long time we can finally show you what we've been cooking :)

Enjoy this Early Access trailer

In this video i hopped on Kong Horror's closed Early Access build to goof off and clip farm. We got lots of cool stuff to add in future and I'm super excited to have you all try it out. Kong Horror drops may 24th on the 2 year Anniversary of Kong's initial launch.

